A '''Team Yell Grunt''' (Japanese: '''エールだんのしたっぱ''' ''Yell Gang Underling'') is a type of [[Pokémon Trainer]] introduced in [[Generation VIII]]. They are members of [[Team Yell]] who are fervent fanatics of [[Marnie]]. In reality, Team Yell Grunts are [[Spikemuth]] {{tc|Gym Trainer}}s wearing face paint and extra punk attire.

They specialize in {{type|Dark}} Pokémon and keep their Pokémon in [[Nest Ball]]s.

